{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An AI menace is invading your motherboard! Can you survive?</strong>! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552540/extras/USBMonster_01.gif?t=1740837034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Neon D-Fence Remastered</strong> is a fast-paced, beginner-friendly tower defense game with an arcade twist! Easy to pick up, fun to master\u2014build your defenses, survive waves of enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552540/extras/Ghost_01.gif?t=1740837034\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552540/extras/Blob_01.gif?t=1740837034\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552540/extras/Hunter_01.gif?t=1740837034\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defend, Upgrade, and Survive!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple &amp; Fun:</strong> Jump in and start defending right away\u2014no complex rules, just pure action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 Unique Maps:</strong> Test your strategy on a variety of layouts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build &amp; Upgrade:</strong> Earn &quot;RAM&quot; and &quot;Data&quot; to place powerful towers and unlock awesome upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face Waves of Enemies:</strong> From grunts to explosive threats and massive bosses, can you outlast them all? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552540/extras/EyeHold_01.gif?t=1740837034\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552540?t=1740837034","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati